      "text": "catch ToolError → ToolEnvelope.fail(code, message)   ·   catch generic Exception → UNKNOWN_ERROR   ·   ALWAYS returns valid JSON — no raw exception ever reaches the AgentExecutor's ReAct loop, the conversation never stalls because of a tool.",
