      "text": "The part that could be 'missing' (the catalog) is hardcoded and therefore infallible; only the customer-profile dependency remains as a failure point.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The part that could be 'missing' (the catalog) is hardcoded and therefore infallible; only the customer-profile dependency remains as a failure point.",
