      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two distinct degradation levels: a technical failure becomes a genuine structured error; no results (no error at all) is handled only by PROMPT INSTRUCTION — 'say you don't have that information, never make it up' — not by code.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
